      {
        "id": 265109,
        "name": "",
        "username": "LonelyMan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2026-02-17T23:02:30.612Z",
        "cooked": "<p>To be clear, a world without conflict can still have suffering.  The influence of the grey probably prevents Aeturnus making things worse here, but they can still harvest what suffering inevitably exists.  World peace doesn’t mean you can’t stub your toe or choke on your food.</p>",
